Subject: [PATCH] Add the dwarf multicannon

Set-up in four stages, loading, firing, pick-up and decay, with the OSRS varps
client plugins read (dropcannon stage, rockthrower ammo, ownedmcannon coord,
mcannon_decayed). A cannon left behind by a logout, or one that decays, goes
back to the owner's bank. Timers mcannon_fire (440) and mcannon_decay (441).
Integration tests in DwarfMulticannonTest.
